{"mode":"words","text":"Här avgör ditt inlärningsmål. Om du bara vill förstå språket har du redan nått ditt mål – fortsätt helt enkelt med steg två och tre. Om du vill tala kommer körövningarna: Ta en kort mening med A-B-upprepningen, ställ in hastigheten på väldigt långsamt och läs samtidigt med rösten – precis som i en kör. Du hör genast om något låter annorlunda och korrigerar dig helt av dig själv. Det går att göra var som helst, till och med på spårvagnen: med hörlurar låter det som ett telefonsamtal. Och om du vill lära dig att skriva, skriv helt enkelt med texten mening för mening.","words":[{"s":0,"e":232},{"s":302,"e":697},{"s":743,"e":871},{"s":952,"e":2090},{"s":2496,"e":2635},{"s":2670,"e":2752},{"s":2821,"e":3181},{"s":3216,"e":3355},{"s":3413,"e":3785},{"s":3843,"e":4423},{"s":4470,"e":4563},{"s":4609,"e":4679},{"s":4737,"e":5050},{"s":5108,"e":5375},{"s":5468,"e":5735},{"s":5828,"e":6177},{"s":6339,"e":6374},{"s":6629,"e":7163},{"s":7233,"e":7500},{"s":7546,"e":7802},{"s":7848,"e":7953},{"s":7976,"e":8290},{"s":8336,"e":8591},{"s":8673,"e":8777},{"s":8824,"e":9265},{"s":9729,"e":9868},{"s":9915,"e":9985},{"s":10031,"e":10240},{"s":10321,"e":10635},{"s":10693,"e":10960},{"s":10983,"e":12028},{"s":12214,"e":12469},{"s":12504,"e":12574},{"s":12644,"e":12899},{"s":13027,"e":13479},{"s":13537,"e":13700},{"s":13828,"e":15349},{"s":15534,"e":15813},{"s":15883,"e":15952},{"s":16010,"e":16707},{"s":16742,"e":16823},{"s":16870,"e":17137},{"s":17206,"e":17949},{"s":18240,"e":18356},{"s":18390,"e":18681},{"s":18704,"e":19261},{"s":19308,"e":19412},{"s":19435,"e":19981},{"s":20004,"e":20027},{"s":20051,"e":20515},{"s":20538,"e":20689},{"s":20759,"e":20794},{"s":20840,"e":20910},{"s":20968,"e":21490},{"s":22222,"e":22361},{"s":22408,"e":22524},{"s":22616,"e":23116},{"s":23162,"e":23232},{"s":23290,"e":23743},{"s":23824,"e":24126},{"s":24184,"e":24857},{"s":25078,"e":25264},{"s":25322,"e":25972},{"s":26007,"e":26088},{"s":26123,"e":26436},{"s":26483,"e":26541},{"s":